WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.380
- So, did anything interesting
happen this weekend?

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.530
In the wake of the now infamous second,

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.950
third Trump tape in which
the President seemed to try

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.040
to influence the Georgia
Secretary of State,

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.830
Brad Raffensberger, and said
specifically I just want to

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.660
find 11,780 votes.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.710
People are wondering if
this is criminal conduct,

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.380
and if the President is
going to be prosecuted?

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.550
Well putting aside the
issue of the criminality

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.310
I'm going to try and do a video on that

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.143
as soon as possible.

00:00:28.143 --> 00:00:30.430
Some people are pretty sure
that this is criminal conduct

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.170
including potentially one of the members

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.670
of the Georgia state election board

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.790
who has asked Brad Raffensberger to start

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.500
a criminal investigation.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.960
Brad Raffensberger has said
that he is not going to

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.530
engage in an investigation
but he left open

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.360
the possibility that the
Fulton County district attorney

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:48.660
could very well start an investigation.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:49.910
So stick around for that video,

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.600
it's going to be coming out very very soon

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.120
and check out my other Eagle Briefs

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.480
where I talk about the legal issues.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.953
And I'll see you in court.

